{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e59abf40bccfdbb56e8244c10e31a81e307656a0fdc188180155f68a55bab0",
      "text": "买了不少东西呢。\n能买到心仪的物品真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ee94e07393694413348a0eec1674dc19ab78774eaea368f3f9f977a918c1a0",
      "text": "帮你拿行李？别在意。\n这点分量，一点也不重。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e2d8af88f532670b56948e95ff76f2e6115605d77e0d2138000d313b07395a2",
      "text": "作为谢礼，今晚可以做任何我想吃的菜？\n让我想想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17505b664cee28e69fd82b7641dee11e914f1d425f5f55f25267f48d0694308a",
      "text": "那么，就拜托汉堡肉排了。\n那是我的最爱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d53f86c2c59ea1b84c042db34b7d7c61668e70bc01abf3ea9449cdac9ac7b42",
      "text": "嗯？……啊，夕阳真美啊。\n能和你一起看真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:437a416a7d6d35e80d08278877efb83f65693f70cfa4acf6248ad7331577e510",
      "text": "……那个。我有话想对你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac29bab78fa5aefd1758bc6648b97dcbfd813565bbab00be65541a72f2cfd597",
      "text": "我一定会让你幸福。\n所以……请和我结婚吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95cd8cac62d5462ac2045c89c724a596d246863132bd6b763c6300c544f82faa",
      "text": "辛苦各位了。\n拍出来的照片非常出色哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a5960c1f8ca2555978aef02cddecfc16fb67b55d6fe730c4f695340e25d0f5",
      "text": "多谢。\n能得到你这样的夸奖，真让人高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856ca77b6d022d97fd9d5d1485cf758521c559a04e2e42fbc669994a96f12f7e",
      "text": "英雄，辛苦了。\n我也觉得拍得很棒。练习的成果充分展现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bec115f5575dfb6cd86706d0e9592ece7cb634e74b6f184237b91ae59929083",
      "text": "明天终于要迎来在教堂的拍摄了呢。\n更加打起精神去面对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b98dee34a5521b50de7e66404132514387e3061c11304b475c3cd4241a9bb9d",
      "text": "说的没错！明天也一起加油吧！\n按今天的状态，肯定没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000203:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a48347e91a066de6721bb22433394f7acbe01bc2aa53e603a9b0a7b3f1249a3",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n话说回来，今天的拍摄，\n大家感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b0bfdc064b8cad33231ba1749136005be8f97c6202b6b6432ce89551c71471f",
      "text": "商场里的情侣\n挺多的。\n托这个的福演得很自然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8b5f71906c19fe0f647a6ad309b18e0e82bd59bca6851fb68c842cfc0c58389",
      "text": "在海边看到的夕阳也很漂亮。\n按那样的状态，我觉得应该\n拍出好照片了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db1b76da8e7ee5eb9581d61b13bcfa1e67361ae4ac6a2fb359824ed8fbc00dc1",
      "text": "就是说嘛！\n我也发挥出最佳水平了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:730da59fe6d574d6dcb633e9a5a0f542e51c9b75aaa51fa1f477bd92298e68b4",
      "text": "刚听说接的是婚纱杂志的工作时，\n最开始真不知道\n会搞成什么样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078b677fb23ad999970eca092866f14b4b8918a79d6fc110db1bf2b801a9cd28",
      "text": "同感。\n不过总算是跨过了第一道\n难关，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb4acc457165657cbfed3c2d0507910e0d586479ff10aeab2eeea81732fedabc",
      "text": "明天就是难度最大的\n教堂拍摄了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eaecc26b99d0122610bdc79ebfa4bd81431d00dc60c4cfa172d9c1991572e1f",
      "text": "确实。\n要是能保持这股势头\n就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000219:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000219:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5873d76980e153c7a0f61f6b1eff967c6725ca2aa0b7868ed3180b9e2a5cfc",
      "text": "没问题的。\n请对自己有信心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000221:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b830711a2687955656c5a3412e6517a8ac8660fdabbc4960e2bd827fd412a71e",
      "text": "谢啦。\n听你这么一说\n心里轻松多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000223:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11863e668b4e472694a4fd6af59fe71beac56165439d81e9b08d4e19b73a1169",
      "text": "不论如何，\n明天都要端正心态去迎战。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
